   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 03e \u00b7 First + last frame \u2192 video (Wan 2.2)\n\n1. Load the **FIRST FRAME** and the **LAST FRAME**. Two shots of the same scene work best (e.g. two poses, or a closed and an open door).\n2. In **PROMPT**, describe what happens between them.\n3. Set **SIZE & LENGTH** to match your images: 1280\u00d7720 landscape, 720\u00d71280 portrait. Length 81 = 5 s at 16 fps.\n4. **Run.**\n\n**FAST MODE?**\n- **true:** Lightning 4-step LoRAs, ~1.5 min at 720p. Use it to try ideas.\n- **false:** full 20-step quality, ~12 min at 720p. Use it for finals.\n\nRun the result through **04** for 2\u00d7 resolution and 32 fps.\nBig jumps between unrelated images (e.g. a painting \u2192 a photo) produce a blurry morph halfway."
   ],
